        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Hot off the heels of the original party-game hit, this next installation of Glee-inspired karaoke plants you right in the center of more of your favorite scenes and musical moments from season one. Take center stage with Rachel Berry, Finn Hudson, Will Schuester and the rest of the cast as you perform to the New Directions' hottest harmonies. Prove you have a voice worthy of regionals to reach new achievements and unlock items for your very own Glee scrapbook in Scrapbook mode, plus, enjoy even more exclusive extras, including never-before-seen show moments in fun video montages with which you can perform. With this truly memorable setlist, you'll be crooning melodies so sweet, you could even melt Sue Sylvester's icy heart.",
